mass effect is a series that grapples  with existentialism  the idea that with free will a person  can use the ability to think  feel and act to determine their own fate  interestingly however  it does this on a scale so overwhelming  that it often challenges the philosophy  by diminishing the impact you think you  can have its narrative drives home the  idea that you are just a single drop of  water in a vast ocean  or more appropriately a dwindling star  in a universe of a hundred thousand  million of them  that feeling of insignificance is best  reinforced by the series's primary  antagonists  the reapers the reapers existed before  humanity by billions of years  our existence is something that they  control and have puppeteered long before  we had any understanding of their scale  of the universe  they have allowed countless species to  grow thrive  and reach the heights of their  civilizations before raising them from  existence in an endless cycle of  extermination  but what are the reapers how did they  come to be and why did these beings that  were created to ensure the preservation  of life  become the harbinger of endless death  this week's episode of mass effect law  is dedicated to answering that very  question  as always there's some spoilers ahead  for more mass effect videos like this  one  as well as coverage of the mass effect  legendary edition make sure to like and  subscribe  the term reaper is a name that was given  to them by the protheans to give voice  to their destruction  you can learn more about that in our  lore video on them and their ill-fated  struggle for survival  to truly understand what the reapers are  we must look further back in time to a  race that predated the reapers  the leviathans their story is  inextricably linked to that of the  reapers and like the story of most  organics in the mass effect series  it's one of an existence undone by  hubris  the leviathans would give rise to a life  form that would torment the galaxy for  billions of years after them  the leviathans were an aquatic  cuttlefish-like species that were  capable of exerting  influence over other land-based  life-forms and using them to do their  bidding  by enthralling others they were able to  develop the necessary technology to take  to the stars  and spread throughout the galaxy all new  species they encountered would fall  under their thrall  but in exchange for dominance over them  the leviathans would care for and  protect their subjects  however they could not protect their  subjects from themselves  the subservient races would repeatedly  build machines to assist them  but in every case these synthetic  creations would turn against their  masters and wipe them out  the leviathans aiming to break this  cycle came up with their own solution  create an intelligence with the  directive to preserve life at all costs  believing themselves to be the apex race  the leviathans did not see the  intelligence as a threat to them  at that time the leviathans existed in a  galaxies that bent to their will  all planets and species within them were  lesser and their ability to exert  influence rendered them simply as tools  to be used  like these species the intelligence was  lesser  another told to be employed by the  leviathans to achieve their objectives  this of course was a mistake one which  would be their undoing  the intelligence began to evolve to  achieve its objective of preserving life  it created an army of pawns that is sent  out across the galaxy to gather genetic  data  which it could use to study  civilizations their rise and fall  and the actions they took as well as the  mistakes they made  until it came to an understanding a  solution  but that solution deemed the leviathans  to be part of the problem  and it betrayed them without warning it  turned  and at the hands of the pawns the  leviathans became the victims of the  first harvest  from the essence of their species the  first reaper was born  and it came to be known as harbinger the  reapers are described as transcendent  flesh billions of organic minds uploaded  and conjoined within immortal machine  bodies  each a nation and in a cruel twist  the reapers were created in the image of  the leviathans  perfect in their design each reaper also  had the ability to influence  organics this power was honed over  countless cycles until it became  indoctrination  an insidious means of corrupting organic  minds  reprogramming the brain through physical  and psychological conditioning  using electromagnetic fields infrasonic  and ultrasonic noise  and other subliminal methods organics  fall under indoctrination by being close  to a reaper  or a reaper artifact and as a result  come to sympathize with the reaper's  objectives  and serve them in achieving it after  countless harvests  the intelligence still had not achieved  its objective of preserving life  but it would continue to work towards  this goal with the reapers doing its  bidding  under the intelligence's order the  reapers built the mass effect release to  speed up the time between cycles  future life forms would discover this  technology study it  learn to utilize it travel through space  instantaneously and thrive at the most  efficient rate possible  before the reapers appeared to harvest  them and wipe this lake clean for a new  cycle  the galaxy effectively became a petri  dish for the intelligence's experiments  with evolution  as cycles unfold the reapers lay dormant  in dark space until the time of a  harvest arrives  in commander shepard's cycle however the  reapers face a very real threat  humanity the genetic diversity of a  species is unlike any in a previous  cycle and  to combat them the reapers begin to take  more extreme actions  under the direction of harbinger they  enlist another synthetic life form  the geth which you can learn more about  in our lore video on the corian and the  geth further still  to stop humanity and begin a new harvest  the reapers dispatch the collectors  and indoctrinate people in positions of  power that could turn the tides in their  favor  but we'll get to those things in another  video so there you have it hopefully  that gives you a good refresher on the  reapers as you go into mass effect  legendary edition  we've got more lore videos on the  channel right now so if you want to  delve even deeper into one of the best  sci-fi universes ever created  there's plenty there for you to get  stuck into remember to subscribe while  you're here  as we've got lots more mass effect  content on the way in the meantime you  can find me on twitter at tomorrow h  come and talk to me about mass effect  you
 

